---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import { songs, meta } from '../lib/data';
const chartCount = songs.reduce((total, song) => total + song.chartCount, 0);
const stats = [['本站曲目', songs.length], ['可玩谱面', chartCount], ['已收录曲绘', meta.counts.jackets], ['充能池', meta.counts.unlockPools]];
const areas = [['曲目库', '按曲名、谱面等级与来源找到每一首。', '/songs/', '♫'], ['数据', '查看理论值与五池解禁资料。', '/jubility/', '数'], ['图鉴', '从版本与玩法理解音乐魔方。', '/versions/', '鉴'], ['关于', '了解数据口径、缺口与纠错方式。', '/about/', '？']];
---
<Layout title="首页" description="jubeat 音乐魔方国服曲目、谱面、解禁和考据的可追溯中文资料站。"><section class="hero w-panel w-panel--glass"><div><span class="eyebrow">CN · WAHLAP / 可追溯资料站</span><span class="w-brand-logo-frame"><img class="w-brand-logo w-brand-logo--hero" src="/brand/jubeat-music-cube-logo.webp" alt="jubeat 音乐魔方"/></span><h1>找到那一首，<br/>也找到它的来处。</h1><p>曲目、谱面、定数、解禁和考据统一收录。每个数字都保留来源，可信差异会并列说明。</p><form action="/songs/" class="search"><label for="hero-search">快捷检索</label><input class="w-field" id="hero-search" name="q" placeholder="搜索曲名或 artist"/><button>查找曲目</button></form><small>本站为非官方资料站；KONAMI、WAHLAP 等名称及相关内容归其权利人所有。</small></div><div class="w-pad-4x4" role="img" aria-label="4乘4触控面板，三格点亮分别代表三种难度">{Array.from({length:16}).map((_, i) => <span class="w-pad-key" data-difficulty={i === 1 ? 'bsc' : i === 7 ? 'adv' : i === 14 ? 'ext' : undefined}></span>)}</div></section><section class="stats" aria-label="资料统计">{stats.map(([label, value]) => <div class="w-card"><strong>{value}</strong><span>{label}</span></div>)}</section><section class="section"><h2>四分区入口</h2><div class="areas">{areas.map(([name, desc, href, mark]) => <a href={href} class="area w-card w-hit-target"><span class="w-diamond-link__icon"><b>{mark}</b></span><span><strong>{name}</strong><small>{desc}</small></span></a>)}</div></section><section class="split section"><article class="w-panel"><h2>从曲目库开始</h2><p>完整静态列表已经放在页面内；即使未启用 JavaScript，也能按曲名进入每一首的资料页。</p><a href="/songs/">进入全量曲目库 →</a></article><article class="w-panel"><h2>资料政策</h2><p>无 BPM、无曲绘与暂无考据会照实显示，不用推测值或伪造素材填补。</p><a href="/about/">查看来源与缺口说明 →</a></article></section></Layout>
<style>.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(220px,360px);gap:var(--w-s-10);align-items:center;margin-top:var(--w-s-8)}.eyebrow{display:block;color:var(--w-hit-deep);font-family:var(--w-font-data);font-size:var(--w-fs-sm);margin-bottom:var(--w-s-3)}h1,h2{font-family:var(--w-font-display);line-height:var(--w-lh-tight)}h1{font-size:var(--w-fs-3xl);margin:var(--w-s-4) 0}p{color:var(--w-ink-soft)}.search{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:var(--w-s-2);margin:var(--w-s-5) 0}.search label{grid-column:1/-1;font-weight:700}.search button{border:1px solid var(--w-hit-deep);border-radius:var(--w-r-sm);background:var(--w-hit);color:var(--w-on-hit);padding:0 var(--w-s-4);font-weight:800}.stats,.areas,.split{display:grid;gap:var(--w-s-4)}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);margin:var(--w-s-6) 0}.stats strong{display:block;font-family:var(--w-font-data);font-size:var(--w-fs-2xl);color:var(--w-hit-deep)}.stats span{color:var(--w-muted)}.section{margin-top:var(--w-s-10)}.areas{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.area{display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;gap:var(--w-s-3);color:var(--w-ink);text-decoration:none}.area small{display:block;color:var(--w-muted);margin-top:var(--w-s-1)}.split{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}@media(max-width:768px){.hero,.split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero>.w-pad-4x4{max-width:260px;margin:auto}.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.areas{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.search{grid-template-columns:1fr}.search button{min-height:var(--w-tap)}}
</style>